pleted webhook payload"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Backend logic"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Use the webhook to populate user profiles or fulfill compliance requirements."}],"\n",["$","$L4",null,{"language":"typescript","code":"$7","children":["$","$L3",null,{"className":"language-typescript","children":"$8"}],"title":"Backend: Webhook handler"}],"\n",["$","$L2",null,{"level":2,"id":"best-practices","children":"Best practices"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. Combine with Identity Verification for KYC"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"language":"txt","children":["The most powerful use of this module is in combination with ",["$","$L3",null,{"children":"identityVerification"}],". This allows you to perform a \"face match,\" comparing the live person to the photo on their ID document, which is a standard requirement for KYC/AML compliance."]}],"\n",["$","$L4",null,{"language":"typescript","code":"const { session, clientSecret } = await client.sessions.create({\n  clientReferenceId: 'user_123',\n  modules: [\n    { type: 'documentAuthentication' },\n    { type: 'identityVerification' }\n  ]\n});\n\n// The session report will include a `faceMatch` result\n","children":["$","$L3",null,{"className":"language-typescript","children":"$9"}],"title":"Backend: KYC with face match"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Supported documents"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"FaceSign supports thousands of document types from over 200 countries and territories. The user interface will automatically adapt to show the correct document types based on the user's selected country."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"3. Image quality"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Advise users to place their document on a flat, dark surface in a well-lit area to ensure high-quality captures and accurate data extraction. The SDK provides real-time feedback to help with this."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"4. Data privacy"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Be transparent with users abou